STILL RECORDING, tape 8: "Fire Door" (2026). Halloway Archive. Original story, pictures, sound and music. A work of fiction.

Pictures: drawn in code (canvas 2D) with the tape kit (channel/brand/tapekit.js): a 2.5D renderer, CCTV grading, the handheld camcorder look, VHS damage and the figure drawing. The service corridor, its copies beyond the fire door, the light and the security office are drawn for this tape (film.js).
Fonts: VT323 (The VT323 Project Authors), SIL Open Font License 1.1. Special Elite (Astigmatic), Apache License 2.0.
Voice: ElevenLabs text-to-speech, model eleven_v4. Leon Marsh: "HA Leon Marsh" (ElevenLabs Voice Design, made for this series).
Sound effects: generated with ElevenLabs Sound Effects (prompts in sfx/prompts.json).
Music: none. A low drone made from the corridor's own duct fan (tools/score.py).
Sound: every sound is in the scene and is heard through Leon's camcorder or CAM 14 (tools/mix.py: rooms, the camcorder's automatic level control, the tape).
